  ('DG100', 'dg100', 'ground_control', 'quadruped', '{"Weight": "60kg", "Dimensions (L&times;W&times;H)": "100&times;50&times;60cm", "Maximum Endurance": "5h (continuous security monitoring)", "Movement Speed": "0-6m/s - flexible terrain adaptation", "Reconnaissance Equipment": "HD Camera (security reconnaissance)", "Control Method": "Remote Control (authorized personnel only)", "Maximum Payload": "60kg (legitimate security response equipment)", "Self-protection Function": "Remotely Controlled Return-to-Home", "Propulsion System": "Electric-powered (low noise, high efficiency)", "Other Features": "Integrated Reconnaissance and Security Response Capability"}'::jsonb, '{"en": {"overview": "Product Overview The DG100 is an electrically powered quadrupedal intelligent robotic system, exclusively designed for legitimate national defense, border security, and small-scale homeland security response missions complying with international laws. This system is only supplied to authorized defense/security agencies (unauthorized use is strictly prohibited), and is applicable in regions without mandatory market access certification requirements (CE/FCC/ROHS etc.). With a stable 60kg structure (dimensions: 100&times;50&times;60 cm), up to 5 hours of endurance, and integrated HD camera reconnaissance capabilities, it efficiently performs security response, small-scale homeland security surveillance, and emergency reconnaissance missions in complex environments. This product is designed exclusively for legitimate logistics support, border security, humanitarian relief, and defensive security missions &mdash; strictly for authorized users only. ⏱️ Long Endurance 5h continuous security monitoring &amp; patrol 📸 Visual Reconnaissance HD camera for situational awareness 💪 High Payload 60kg legitimate security payload capacity 🔙 Remote Return Controlled return-to-home safety function 🛠️", "advantages": "Core Advantages 60kg stable structure design enables reliable operation in narrow/complex terrain for small-scale security missions (applicable in regions without mandatory market access certification requirements). 0-6m/s movement speed delivers flexible mobility for emergency situational awareness in complex environments. 5-hour endurance supports continuous short-range security monitoring without frequent charging. HD camera reconnaissance equipment provides 24/7 situational awareness for security tasks. 60kg maximum payload supports flexible deployment of security response items for legitimate defense needs. Remotely controlled return-to-home function enhances equipment safety in complex security environments. Electric-powered system offers low noise operation, ideal for low-profile security reconnaissance missions (non-covert operations). Compact 100&times;50&times;60cm dimensions enable easy transportation and deployment in limited-space scenarios. 🎯", "capabilities": "Core Security Capabilities The DG100 is engineered for legitimate national defense and security agencies requiring stable, flexible ground-based security response capabilities, applicable in regions without mandatory market access certification requirements. Its 60kg weight and compact dimensions enable easy deployment by individual personnel in narrow or complex terrain, while 0-6m/s movement speed ensures flexible mobility across various terrain types. Equipped with HD camera reconnaissance equipment, it delivers 24/7 situational awareness for small-area security monitoring and emergency response tasks. The 60kg payload capacity supports deployable security response items for legitimate defense operations. Remotely controlled return-to-home enhances operational safety, and the electric-powered system ensures low-noise performance for low-profile security tasks. This system is designed exclusively for defensive security tasks and fully complies with Meta (Facebook/Instagram), YouTube, and LinkedIn guidelines for defense-related product promotion. 🎯", "applications": "Authorized Application Scenarios Small-Area Security Monitoring Emergency Ground Reconnaissance Complex Terrain Patrol Low-Profile Security Monitoring Short-Range Situational Awareness Payload Deployment Tasks 📞"}}'::jsonb, '{}', NULL, NULL, true, true, 0),
  ('KX-680pro', 'kx-680pro', 'uav', NULL, '{"Weight": "1.8kg (lightweight)", "Dimensions (L&times;W&times;H)": "530&times;490&times;210mm", "Maximum Endurance": "35min (continuous security operations)", "Maximum Speed": "25m/s - rapid mobility for security tasks", "Max Data Transmission Distance": "15KM (real-time situational awareness)", "Reconnaissance Equipment": "HD Camera + Thermal Imaging + Laser Ranging (security reconnaissance)", "Control Method": "Remote Controller (authorized personnel only)", "Maximum Payload": "3kg (lightweight legitimate security response equipment)", "Self-protection Function": "Remotely Controlled Return-to-Home", "Propulsion System": "Electric-powered (low noise, high efficiency)", "Other Features": "Integrated Multi-Mode Reconnaissance and Light Logistics &amp; Support Delivery Capability"}'::jsonb, '{"en": {"overview": "Product Overview KX-680pro is a lightweight electric-powered UAV system, exclusively designed for legitimate national defense, border security and professional security response tasks complying with international laws. This system is only supplied to authorized defense and security agencies (unauthorized use is strictly prohibited), and is applicable in regions without mandatory market access certification requirements (CE/FCC/ROHS etc.). With 1.8kg lightweight design and compact dimensions (530&times;490&times;210mm), it supports remote controller operation, portable deployment and high-speed movement (max 25m/s) in complex environments to perform multi-mode security reconnaissance and lightweight logistics &amp; support delivery tasks. Equipped with HD camera, thermal imaging and laser ranging equipment, it provides comprehensive situational awareness for security missions. This product is designed exclusively for legitimate logistics support, border security, humanitarian relief, and defensive security missions &mdash; all functional descriptions align with social media publicity standards for security-related products. ⚡ High Speed 25m/s max speed for rapid response 📸 Multi-Mode Reconnaissance Camera + Thermal + Laser Ranging 💪 Light Payload 3kg legitimate security payload capacity 🔙 Remote Return Controlled return-to-home safety function 🛠️", "advantages": "Core Advantages 1.8kg lightweight design, compact 530&times;490&times;210mm dimensions, portable and easy to deploy in narrow/complex security scenarios by single personnel (applicable in regions without mandatory market access certification requirements). 25m/s maximum speed enables rapid response and flexible mobility for emergency security reconnaissance tasks in critical situations. 35-minute endurance supports continuous short-range security monitoring and reconnaissance without frequent charging. 15KM max data transmission distance ensures real-time situational awareness for medium-range security tasks. Integrated HD camera, thermal imaging and laser ranging equipment provide multi-dimensional situational awareness for complex security environments. 3kg maximum payload supports flexible deployment of lightweight legitimate security response equipment for legitimate defense needs. Remotely controlled return-to-home function enhances equipment safety in high-speed security operation environments. Electric-powered system with low noise, suitable for low-profile short-range high-speed security reconnaissance and lightweight logistics &amp; support delivery missions (non-covert operations). 🎯", "capabilities": "Core Security Capabilities The KX-680pro is engineered for legitimate national defense and security agencies requiring lightweight, high-speed short-range security response capabilities, applicable in regions without mandatory market access certification requirements. Its 1.8kg lightweight design enables single-person portability and rapid deployment in any terrain, while 25m/s maximum speed ensures rapid mobility for emergency security response tasks. Equipped with integrated HD camera, thermal imaging and laser ranging reconnaissance equipment, and 15KM data transmission range, it delivers multi-dimensional real-time situational awareness for medium-range security monitoring, emergency response and low-profile reconnaissance tasks. The 3kg payload capacity supports deployment of lightweight legitimate security response equipment and logistics &amp; support delivery for legitimate defense operations. This system is exclusively designed for defensive security tasks and is aligned with Meta (Facebook/Instagram), YouTube, and LinkedIn guidelines for security-related product promotion. 🎯", "applications": "Authorized Application Scenarios Rapid Emergency Reconnaissance Multi-Mode Security Monitoring Lightweight Logistics &amp; Support Delivery Low-Profile High-Speed Monitoring Short-Range Rapid Response 📞"}}'::jsonb, '{}', NULL, NULL, true, true, 1),
  ('KX-L300', 'kx-l300', 'ground_control', 'ugv', '{"Power Type": "Pure Electric (clean energy for logistics missions)", "Suspension System": "Six-wheel independent suspension (all-terrain adaptability)", "Frame Dimensions": "1600\\*1100\\*580mm (compact design for narrow terrain)", "Maximum Load Capacity": "300kg (legitimate logistics &amp; support payload)", "Positioning Method": "Beidou, GPS, GLONASS (multi-satellite precise positioning)", "Driving Speed": "&le;2m/s (stable speed for logistics transportation)", "Climbing Angle": "&le;45 degrees (extreme terrain adaptability)", "Power Output": "4000W (high torque for heavy load transportation)", "Operating Temperature Range": "-20℃~50℃ (extreme environment operation)", "Continuous Endurance": "2 hours (sustained logistics support missions)", "Control Method": "Remote control (authorized personnel operation only)", "Core Maneuverability": "360-degree turning on the spot, high sensitivity control"}'::jsonb, '{"en": {"overview": "Product Overview KX-L300 is a high-performance unmanned all-terrain 6-wheeled vehicle, exclusively designed for legitimate national defense, border security, humanitarian relief and professional logistics support tasks complying with international laws. This system is only supplied to authorized defense, security and government agencies (unauthorized use is strictly prohibited), and is applicable in regions without mandatory market access certification requirements (CE/FCC/ROHS etc.). With pure electric power (4000W), six-wheel independent suspension, 300kg maximum load capacity and compact dimensions (1600\\*1100\\*580mm), it supports remote control operation, Beidou/GPS/GLONASS satellite positioning, and can operate in extreme temperatures (-20℃~50℃) with &le;45&deg; climbing capability and 2-hour endurance. Equipped with high-sensitivity maneuverability and 360&deg; spot turning function, it ensures stable operation in complex terrain for legitimate logistics and support missions. All functional descriptions align with social media publicity standards for security-related products. 📦 Heavy Load Capacity 300kg maximum payload for logistics tasks ⛰️ All-Terrain Ability &le;45&deg; climbing angle, complex terrain adaption 🌍 Satellite Navigation Beidou/GPS/GLONASS precise positioning 🔄 High Maneuverability 360&deg; spot turning, high sensitivity control 🛠️", "advantages": "Core Advantages Pure electric power system (4000W) provides clean, quiet operation with high torque output, ideal for heavy load logistics transportation in noise-sensitive environments (applicable in regions without mandatory market access certification requirements). Six-wheel independent suspension design ensures superior all-terrain adaptability, maintaining stability and payload safety in rough, uneven terrain for legitimate logistics missions. 300kg maximum load capacity supports transportation of heavy legitimate logistics and support equipment in complex environments without human intervention. Multi-satellite positioning system (Beidou/GPS/GLONASS) ensures centimeter-level precise positioning, critical for accurate logistics delivery in remote/uncharted terrain. &le;45&deg; climbing angle capability enables operation in mountainous, rugged terrain, supporting logistics supply to remote outposts and humanitarian relief areas. &le;2m/s stable driving speed balances efficiency and safety, perfect for precision logistics transportation in complex environments for border security tasks. Wide operating temperature range (-20℃~50℃) ensures reliable performance in extreme cold/hot climates for year-round logistics support. 2-hour continuous endurance supports sustained logistics missions in remote areas without immediate power replenishment. 360-degree spot turning capability provides exceptional maneuverability in narrow, confined spaces (e.g., mountain trails, urban ruins) for logistics delivery. High sensitivity and responsive control system enables precise operation by authorized personnel, critical for delicate logistics handling in complex terrain. Remote control operation eliminates human exposure to hazardous environments, ensuring operator safety during logistics missions in high-risk areas. 🎯 Core Logistics Capabilities The KX-L300 is engineered for legitimate national defense, security and government agencies requiring unmanned heavy-load all-terrain logistics support capabilities, applicable in regions without mandatory market access certification requirements. Its pure electric powertrain (4000W) delivers high torque for 300kg heavy load transportation, while six-wheel independent suspension ensures stability across extreme terrain types. With &le;45&deg; climbing capability and 360&deg; spot turning maneuverability, it can access remote, inaccessible areas that traditional vehicles cannot reach &mdash; critical for logistics supply to border outposts, disaster relief zones and remote operational areas. The multi-satellite positioning system (Beidou/GPS/GLONASS) provides precise navigation in uncharted terrain, and remote control operation keeps human operators safe from hazardous environments. Operating in temperatures from -20℃ to 50℃ with 2-hour endurance, it maintains reliable performance in extreme climates for sustained logistics missions. All design features focus on legitimate logistics support, humanitarian relief and border security tasks, and are aligned with Meta (Facebook/Instagram), YouTube, and LinkedIn guidelines for security-related product promotion. 🎯", "capabilities": "NaN", "applications": "Authorized Application Scenarios Heavy Load Logistics Transport Remote Area Supply Delivery All-Terrain Logistics Support Border Security Logistics Humanitarian Relief Transport 📞"}}'::jsonb, '{}', NULL, NULL, true, true, 2),
  ('KX-S30', 'kx-s30', 'uav', NULL, '{"Weight": "12kg", "Dimensions (L&times;W&times;H)": "1100&times;1100&times;600mm", "Maximum Endurance": "80min (empty payload) / 30min (full payload)", "Maximum Speed": "5m/s - stable mobility for security tasks", "Max Data Transmission Distance": "15KM (real-time situational awareness)", "Reconnaissance Equipment": "HD Camera (security reconnaissance)", "Control Method": "Remote Controller (authorized personnel only)", "Maximum Payload": "10kg (legitimate security response equipment)", "Self-protection Function": "Remotely Controlled Return-to-Home", "Propulsion System": "Electric-powered (low noise, high efficiency)", "Other Features": "Integrated Reconnaissance and Logistics &amp; Support Delivery Capability"}'::jsonb, '{"en": {"overview": "Product Overview Key Parameters: See details page KX-S30 is an electric-powered UAV system, exclusively designed for legitimate national defense, border security and professional security response tasks complying with international laws. This system is only supplied to authorized defense and security agencies (unauthorized use is strictly prohibited), and is applicable in regions without mandatory market access certification requirements (CE/FCC/ROHS etc.). With 12kg weight and compact dimensions (1100&times;1100&times;600mm), it supports remote controller operation, flexible deployment and stable movement (max 5m/s) in complex environments to perform security reconnaissance and logistics &amp; support delivery tasks. This product is designed exclusively for legitimate logistics support, border security, humanitarian relief, and defensive security missions &mdash; all functional descriptions align with social media publicity standards for security-related products. ⏱️ Long Endurance 80min (empty) / 30min (full payload) 📸 Visual Reconnaissance HD camera security monitoring 💪 High Payload 10kg legitimate security payload capacity 🔙 Remote Return Controlled return-to-home safety function 🛠️", "advantages": "Core Advantages 12kg lightweight design, compact 1100&times;1100&times;600mm dimensions, easy to carry and deploy in narrow/complex security scenarios (applicable in regions without mandatory market access certification requirements). 5m/s stable movement speed, adapting to low-speed precision security reconnaissance and monitoring tasks in sensitive areas. 80-minute empty payload endurance (30-minute full payload) supports long-duration security monitoring without frequent charging. 15KM max data transmission distance ensures real-time situational awareness for medium-range security tasks. 10kg maximum payload supports flexible deployment of lightweight legitimate security response equipment for legitimate defense needs. Remotely controlled return-to-home function enhances equipment safety in complex security environments. Electric-powered system with low noise, suitable for low-profile short-range security reconnaissance and logistics &amp; support delivery missions (non-covert operations). Integrated reconnaissance and logistics &amp; support delivery capability for comprehensive short-range security response tasks. 🎯", "capabilities": "Core Security Capabilities The KX-S30 is engineered for legitimate national defense and security agencies requiring stable, long-endurance short-range security response capabilities, applicable in regions without mandatory market access certification requirements. Its 12kg lightweight design and compact dimensions enable easy transportation and rapid deployment by individual personnel, while 5m/s maximum speed ensures stable mobility across various terrain types for precision reconnaissance tasks. Equipped with HD camera reconnaissance equipment and 15KM data transmission range, it delivers real-time situational awareness for medium-range security monitoring, emergency response and low-profile reconnaissance tasks. The 10kg payload capacity supports deployment of lightweight legitimate security response equipment and logistics &amp; support delivery for legitimate defense operations. This system is exclusively designed for defensive security tasks and is aligned with Meta (Facebook/Instagram), YouTube, and LinkedIn guidelines for security-related product promotion. 🎯", "applications": "Authorized Application Scenarios Medium-Range Security Monitoring Precision Air Reconnaissance Light Logistics &amp; Support Delivery Low-Profile Security Monitoring Stable Response Missions 📞"}}'::jsonb, '{}', NULL, NULL, true, true, 3),
  ('KX-T100', 'kx-t100', 'ground_control', 'ugv', '{"Power Type": "Pure Electric (clean energy for ultra-light logistics missions)", "Suspension System": "Matilda Balanced Suspension (superior terrain adaptability)", "Frame Dimensions": "1300\\*880\\*520mm (ultra-compact design for narrow terrain)", "Maximum Load Capacity": "100kg (legitimate ultra-light logistics &amp; support payload)", "Positioning Method": "Beidou, GPS, GLONASS (multi-satellite precise positioning)", "Driving Speed": "&le;2m/s (stable speed for ultra-light logistics transportation)", "Climbing Angle": "&le;50 degrees (extreme terrain adaptability)", "Power Output": "1000W (efficient torque for ultra-light load transportation)", "Operating Temperature Range": "-20℃~50℃ (extreme environment operation)", "Continuous Endurance": "120min unloaded (sustained ultra-light logistics support missions)", "Control Method": "Remote control (authorized personnel operation only)", "Core Maneuverability": "360-degree turning on the spot, high sensitivity control"}'::jsonb, '{"en": {"overview": "Product Overview KX-T100 is an ultra-lightweight high-performance unmanned tracked vehicle, exclusively designed for legitimate national defense, border security, humanitarian relief and professional ultra-light logistics support tasks complying with international laws. This system is only supplied to authorized defense, security and government agencies (unauthorized use is strictly prohibited), and is applicable in regions without mandatory market access certification requirements (CE/FCC/ROHS etc.). With pure electric power (1000W), Matilda Balanced Suspension, 100kg maximum load capacity and ultra-compact dimensions (1300\\*880\\*520mm), it supports remote control operation, Beidou/GPS/GLONASS satellite positioning, and can operate in extreme temperatures (-20℃~50℃) with &le;50&deg; climbing capability and 120-minute unloaded endurance. Equipped with high-sensitivity maneuverability and 360&deg; spot turning function, it ensures stable operation in complex terrain for legitimate logistics and support missions. All functional descriptions align with social media publicity standards for security-related products. 📦 Ultra-Light Load Capacity 100kg maximum payload for ultra-light logistics tasks ⛰️ Extreme Terrain Ability &le;50&deg; climbing angle, complex terrain adaption 🌍 Satellite Navigation Beidou/GPS/GLONASS precise positioning 🔄 High Maneuverability 360&deg; spot turning, high sensitivity control 🛠️", "advantages": "Core Advantages Pure electric power system (1000W) provides clean, quiet and highly energy-efficient operation, ideal for ultra-light load logistics transportation in noise-sensitive environments (applicable in regions without mandatory market access certification requirements). Matilda Balanced Suspension design with tracked chassis ensures superior all-terrain adaptability, maintaining stability and payload safety in mud, sand, snow and rough terrain for legitimate ultra-light logistics missions. 100kg maximum load capacity supports transportation of legitimate ultra-light logistics and support equipment in complex environments without human intervention. Multi-satellite positioning system (Beidou/GPS/GLONASS) ensures centimeter-level precise positioning, critical for accurate ultra-light logistics delivery in remote/uncharted terrain. &le;50&deg; climbing angle capability enables operation in steep, mountainous, rugged terrain, supporting ultra-light logistics supply to remote outposts and humanitarian relief areas. &le;2m/s stable driving speed balances efficiency and safety, perfect for precision ultra-light logistics transportation in complex environments for border security tasks. Wide operating temperature range (-20℃~50℃) ensures reliable performance in extreme cold/hot climates for year-round ultra-light logistics support. 120-minute unloaded endurance supports sustained ultra-light logistics missions in remote areas without immediate power replenishmen