SS) provides precise navigation in uncharted terrain, and remote control operation keeps human operators safe from hazardous environments. Operating in temperatures from -20℃ to 50℃ with 120-minute unloaded endurance, it maintains reliable performance in extreme climates for sustained ultra-light logistics missions. The ultra-compact 1300\\*880\\*520mm frame design enables operation in extremely narrow spaces while carrying ultra-light payloads, making it ideal for urban and rural ultra-light logistics support in complex environments. All design features focus on legitimate ultra-light logistics support, humanitarian relief and border security tasks, and are aligned with Meta (Facebook/Instagram), YouTube, and LinkedIn guidelines for security-related product promotion. 🎯", "capabilities": "NaN", "applications": "Authorized Application Scenarios Ultra-Light Load Logistics Transport Extreme Terrain Supply Delivery Narrow Space Logistics Support Border Security Ultra-Light Logistics Humanitarian Relief Transport 📞"}}'::jsonb, '{}', NULL, NULL, true, true, 4),
