  ('KX-T300', 'kx-t300', 'ground_control', 'ugv', '{"Power Type": "Pure Electric (clean energy for logistics missions)", "Suspension System": "Matilda Balanced Suspension (superior terrain adaptability)", "Frame Dimensions": "1700\\*1100\\*500mm (compact design for narrow terrain)", "Maximum Load Capacity": "300kg (legitimate logistics &amp; support payload)", "Positioning Method": "Beidou, GPS, GLONASS (multi-satellite precise positioning)", "Driving Speed": "&le;2m/s (stable speed for logistics transportation)", "Climbing Angle": "&le;45 degrees (extreme terrain adaptability)", "Power Output": "4000W (high torque for heavy load transportation)", "Operating Temperature Range": "-20℃~50℃ (extreme environment operation)", "Continuous Endurance": "2 hours (sustained logistics support missions)", "Control Method": "Remote control (authorized personnel operation only)", "Core Maneuverability": "360-degree turning on the spot, high sensitivity control"}'::jsonb, '{"en": {"overview": "Product Overview KX-T300 is a high-performance unmanned tracked vehicle, exclusively designed for legitimate national defense, border security, humanitarian relief and professional logistics support tasks complying with international laws. This system is only supplied to authorized defense, security and government agencies (unauthorized use is strictly prohibited), and is applicable in regions without mandatory market access certification requirements (CE/FCC/ROHS etc.). With pure electric power (4000W), Matilda Balanced Suspension, 300kg maximum load capacity and compact dimensions (1700\\*1100\\*500mm), it supports remote control operation, Beidou/GPS/GLONASS satellite positioning, and can operate in extreme temperatures (-20℃~50℃) with &le;45&deg; climbing capability and 2-hour endurance. Equipped with high-sensitivity maneuverability and 360&deg; spot turning function, it ensures stable operation in complex terrain for legitimate logistics and support missions. All functional description