uthorized personnel, critical for delicate logistics handling in complex terrain. Remote control operation eliminates human exposure to hazardous environments, ensuring operator safety during logistics missions in high-risk areas. Tracked chassis design distributes weight evenly, preventing sinking in soft ground (mud, sand, snow) and ensuring passage in challenging terrain for legitimate logistics tasks. 🎯 Core Logistics Capabilities The KX-T300 is engineered for legitimate national defense, security and government agencies requiring unmanned heavy-load tracked all-terrain logistics support capabilities, applicable in regions without mandatory market access certification requirements. Its pure electric powertrain (4000W) delivers high torque for 300kg heavy load transportation, while Matilda Balanced Suspension with tracked chassis ensures unrivaled stability across extreme terrain types including mud, sand, snow and rocky ground. With &le;45&deg; climbing capability and 360&deg; spot turning maneuverability, it can access remote, inaccessible areas that wheeled vehicles cannot reach &mdash; critical for logistics supply to border outposts, disaster relief zones and remote operational areas. The multi-satellite positioning system (Beidou/GPS/GLONASS) provides precise navigation in uncharted terrain, and remote control operation keeps human operators safe from hazardous environments. Operating in temperatures from -20℃ to 50℃ with 2-hour endurance, it maintains reliable performance in extreme climates for sustained logistics missions. The compact 1700\\*1100\\*500mm frame design enables operation in narrow spaces while carrying heavy payloads, making it ideal for urban and rural logistics support in complex environments. All design features focus on legitimate logistics support, humanitarian relief and border security tasks, and are aligned with Meta (Facebook/Instagram), YouTube, and LinkedIn guidelines for security-related product promotion. 🎯", "capabilities": "N